.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711240/extras/36d116d2e398a7d10278166ad063f4a1.mp4?t=1753548287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-rich gameplay</strong> with emotional narrative and character development</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action combat</strong> against many enemies and bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration </strong>and revealing hidden secrets and lore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully voiced cutscenes</strong> and anime-inspired visuals for immersive storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original soundtrack</strong> that sets the mood across dramatic and peaceful moments</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711240/extras/59a967c4c1a6c7e9ac5c4f4a8e79d7eb.poster.avif?t=1753548287\" width=800 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711240/extras/59a967c4c1a6c7e9ac5c4f4a8e79d7eb.webm?t=1753548287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711240/extras/59a967c4c1a6c7e9ac5c4f4a8e79d7eb.mp4?t=1753548287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
